WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:07.440
Dr. DeVries, the biggest fan of tabletop games
at Site-19, decided to give SCP-914, the Clockworks,

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:14.980
one complete core set of the "DungeHe only
tested it on fine, with the result being one

00:00:14.980 --> 00:00:21.510
large book measuring 2" by 11" by 9" titled
"The Complete Dungeons and Dragons Core Set

00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:22.510
3.5e".

00:00:22.510 --> 00:00:27.500
Upon inspection, the book was determined to
be a combined version of all three previous

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:30.099
books written in 'Milwich' English font.

00:00:30.099 --> 00:00:34.980
Dr. DeVries appended a note to the file on
this test, saying, “'ll be keeping this

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:37.040
in the lounge if anyone wants to use this.

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:39.399
I'll also be holding a game next Tuesday.

00:00:39.399 --> 00:00:41.090
Bring your own character sheets.”

00:00:41.090 --> 00:00:41.109
ons and Dragons" books in 3.5e.

